- Helper tests in `test_sync_timedb_archive.py`: `only_when_no_remaining_raw`, `allow_auto_seal=False` skips auto-seal, `daily_tar_paths_from_pending_archive_tasks`, `collect_days_with_unmapped_closed_raw`, `build_day_close_disqualified_daily_tars` union.
- Supervisor test in `test_sync_timedb_supervisor.py`: hygiene is scheduled, runs canonical seal → raw → `.tar` order, passes `skip_daily_tar_paths`, sets `allow_auto_seal=False`, and the preflight skips with no eligible work.
